  "description": "UVEDOP01 crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/a. Reported CIF formula moiety: C44 H99 Ce3 O11. From the CIF bond table, Ce2 (Ce) has 6 O neighbors; Ce3 (Ce) has 6 O neighbors; Ce1 (Ce) has 6 O neighbors; Ce6 (Ce) has 6 O neighbors; Ce4 (Ce) has 6 O neighbors; Ce5 (Ce) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.694-3.744 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.34-103.09°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula Ce3(OtBu)11.",
